{
 "version": 1,
 "name": "lantern",
 "archetype": "prop.lantern",
 "description": "A hanging hurricane oil lantern standing on its tank: a painted (red, green, black) or galvanised fuel tank with a filler cap, a brass burner with a wick knob, a clear glass globe with wire guards, two air tubes up to a vented cap, a bail handle on a hinge (it folds down about x), and an emissive flame on the wick.",
